'''The Golden Face''' (金のカオル君, ''Kin no Kaoru-kun'', '''Golden Kaoru-kun''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[The Face]]. It was added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = The Golden Face
|image = E 771.png
|first appearance = [[Cats Abloom!#Discover Easter's Wonders!|Discover Easter's Wonders!]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is essentially a super-buffed [[The Face]], with higher overall stats, a 30% chance for a [[Critical Hit]] and nearly as much movement speed as [[Shy Boy]]. Like the [[Golden Doge|other]] [[Gold Hippoe|golden]] [[Pure Gold R.Ost|enemies]], it does not have a unique trait and remains [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]].

==Strategy==
Due to its Floating trait, The Golden Face is stalled efficiently and killed quickly with many available [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating cats]]. Units such as [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]], [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]], [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Mewtone]], etc., can deal damage to it at a safe range. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] can be used if you want to get some quick damage in when The Golden Face is waiting to attack. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is the best option for tanking it, being able to [[Resistant|Resist]] Floating and blocking [[Two Can]]s [[Wave Attack]]s in its debut stage. An honourable mention goes to [[Gold Brick Cat (Special Cat)|King Nekokhamen]] too.

The 30% chance to Critical Hit isn't anything to be afraid of. The Golden Face fails to Crit more than it succeeds, and since its base attack is already above the threshold that most meatshields can survive, it'll usually end on one-shotting them no matter what. The most notable exception is King Nekokhamen, who only survives an attack if it doesn't Crit, even at max level. Just don't bring [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Macho]] if you don't want to chance it.

