==Trivia==
*The Golden Face may be a reference to the [https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000013.000051145.html gold Hitoshi-kun doll] from the quiz show ''[[wikipedia:ja:日立 世界・ふしぎ発見!|Hitachi Sekai Fushigi Hakken!]]'' (日立 世界・ふしぎ発見!). The show's name roughly translates to "Discover the World's Mysteries!", which is somewhat similar to The Golden Face's debut map, [[Cats Abloom!#Discover Easter's Wonders!|Discover Easter's Wonders!]].

